maksu etsiv\u00e4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dgn6F0H8AVoQ7kNvwEg4BA9&_nc_oc=Ado99oJ14grimDGvZ-lTKKnSwOYW2-QhMJqLk6yJwR-UP8Jlv60WspfPtE0rx6hnNuo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL4BXUUx0MtJ1U4-V_tiwpmYAIVn3-YtlMLK2Vf0HT_RA&oe=6AA94254"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qUoZWoDwMIMQ7kNvwFF_a0q&_nc_oc=AdogGPGDRlnNzT_SEVQVqAf_xTaIt_06ZaN1EQ_hpxBurGnvGJ8kZ56qlRS-MjtthZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJTckPJLSQ5xiihT_kkwOuB9H8XGKbNeC79ZUM_JFD7xQ&oe=6AA94732"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZgLgpXn-6u0Q7kNvwGvqVXf&_nc_oc=AdrtMz8jDtvtiLerHmDgh8TE5uYSzStbZgzJZHEAGAtLC7DJlyGSI2gDRR3ki-okVMg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIhaJQPMroJOMI6eQ79Ry3cHmXYxHIpr5aQimh7nyn7Ew&oe=6AA954D5"}, {"file_name":